{"n": 52, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "52.webp", "text": "Cars with Automatic Transmigsion\nUnscrew oil pipes on oil sump\n\nPull off plugs on temperature sensors.\n\n440 1) 126\n\nUnscrew oil pipes on oil cooler.\nInstallation:\n\nCheck gaskets, replacing if necessary.\nTightening torque: 25 Nm (18 ft. Ibs.),\n\nUnscrew idle speed control.\n\nDisconnect ground lead on engine carrier.\nUnscrew left and right engine mounts.\n\nDisconnect prop and gas pressuré springs,\nand install Special Tool 51 2 120.\n\nCaution! Installation:\n\n51 2 120 Use retainer (1). Tightening torque for rubber mounts to engine\nInstallation: carrier: 45 Nm (32.5 ft. Ibs.).\nInsert plastic part 12).\n\nLift out engine with Special Tool 11 0 000.\nNote:\n\nA removed engine with installed hydraulic\nvalve adjusting elements must not remain\nupside down longer than 10 minutes, since\notherwise oil would run out of these elements\nand they could no longer be used.\n\nUnscrew engine damper on console.\n\n4011125", "words": [["Cars", 0.7538, 0.0716, 0.7751, 0.0822], ["with", 0.7781, 0.0723, 0.7994, 0.0822], ["Automatic", 0.8034, 0.0716, 0.8541, 0.0822], ["Transmigsion", 0.8587, 0.0716, 0.9205, 0.0816], ["Unscrew", 0.7543, 0.0882, 0.7953, 0.0988], ["oil", 0.7984, 0.0882, 0.8105, 0.0981], ["pipes", 0.8146, 0.0902, 0.8389, 0.0995], ["on", 0.843, 0.0902, 0.8546, 0.0981], ["oil", 0.8582, 0.0875, 0.8693, 0.0975], ["sump", 0.8739, 0.0902, 0.8987, 0.0995], ["Pull", 0.2624, 0.0729, 0.2796, 0.0836], ["off", 0.2837, 0.0729, 0.2979, 0.0836], ["plugs", 0.3014, 0.0729, 0.3257, 0.0855], ["on", 0.3288, 0.0756, 0.3404, 0.0836], ["temperature", 0.345, 0.0749, 0.4017, 0.0849], ["sensors.", 0.4053, 0.0756, 0.4407, 0.0836], ["440", 0.6834, 0.2805, 0.6996, 0.2905], ["1)", 0.7067, 0.2805, 0.7133, 0.2865], ["126", 0.7214, 0.2798, 0.7356, 0.2878], ["Unscrew", 0.7543, 0.307, 0.7953, 0.3176], ["oil", 0.7989, 0.3064, 0.8105, 0.317], ["pipes", 0.8146, 0.309, 0.8394, 0.319], ["on", 0.843, 0.309, 0.8546, 0.317], ["oil", 0.8582,